bolites including adenine, cytosine, anddeoxycytidine were enriched in mice with liver ﬁbrosis, while 7 purine metabolites (deoxyinosine, 2-hydroxyadenine, inosine,hypoxanthine, N6-methyladenosine, adenosine, anddeoxyguanosine), and 5 pyrimidine metabolites (2 ′- deoxyuridine, thiamine, thymine, thymidine, and ribothymidine) were decreased in mice with CCl 4-treatment compared with those with vehicles. Four organic compounds[3-(3-Hydroxyphenyl)propan oic acid, daidzein, cellobiose, and zearalenone] were decreased, and D-mannitol wasincreased in mice with CCl 4compared with NC. The primary bile acid cholic acid and the secondary bile acidlithocholic acid were increased while the conjugatedtaurocholate was decreased in CCl 4-treated mice. The lipid metabolites of palmitic acid and pentadecanoic acid were alsosigniﬁcantly altered in CCl 4-treated mice. The CCl 4treatment also disturbed the metabolism of pyruvate, vitamin B6, betaine, histidine, and",True,0,gpt-4.1-mini,OpenAI Ada-002 (CPU/Cloud),biomedical-review
