nt c.-10C>T c.196G>C (p.E66Q) c.335G>A (p.R112H) c.625T>C (p.W209R) c.640-801G>A c.725T>C (p.I242T) c.800T>C (p.M267T) c.1067G>A (p.R356Q) c.1171A>G (p.K391E) no variant (caption on next page)T. Sawada et al. Molecular Genetics and Metabolism Reports 44 (2025) 101245 4 Fig. 1.(A) Plasma α-galactosidase A (AGAL) enzyme activity. The vertical solid and dashed lines represent ␀2 SD (3.3 nmol ⋅h␀1 mL␀1)",True,0,gpt-4.1-mini,OpenAI Ada-002 (CPU/Cloud),biomedical-review
